        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-top: 40px;">3. Protection functions</h2>
        <p>The protection relay offers integrated protection functions including two-stage residual overvoltage and undervoltage protection, as well as single-stage negative phase-sequence overvoltage protection and single-stage positive phase-sequence undervoltage protection.</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px; text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_diagram_1.png" alt="Protection function overview of REU610" style="max-width: 80%; height: auto;">
